        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious two bed mid terrace residence</li><li> Popular location on East side of Galway City</li><li> Walking distance of ATU College & Campus</li><li> Access to local National & Secondary schools</li><li> Paved front driveway with ample off-street parking</li><li> Private rear garden with rear gated pedestrian access</li><li> Host of shops & outdoor facilities in the area</li><li> Regular daily bus route to & from Galway city</li><li> Easy access to several work hubs & multinationals</li><li> Close to Bon Secour, Galway Clinic & Merlin Park</ul>"
